-- title:
--   Eventual raw broad-pool surplus with three guard coordinates
-- statement:
--   Fix natural $W,K,m$ and positive real $c,\delta_*$. Eventually in $n$, every complete rough label $r$ at cutoff $y(n)$ that is intrinsically active and nonexceptional at $(n,\delta_*)$ satisfies
--   $$|\mathcal B_{W,K}(n,h_c(n),y(n);r)|\ge\max\{m,T(n,h_c(n),y(n);r)\}+3,$$
--   where $T$ is the full upper complete-rough-row target and $\mathcal B$ is the raw broad correction pool.
--
--   The surplus accommodates both an arbitrary fixed pool minimum and the literal three-coordinate guard budget.
